  "name": "Nifty 310pm ATM Straddle Buyer",
  "description": "\n<p><strong>Nifty 3:10 PM Intraday ATM Straddle Buyer Strategy</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Strategy Notes & Trading Intent:</strong></p>\n<p>--------------------------------------------------</p>\n<p>1. <strong>Entry Criteria:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Underlying:</strong> NIFTY 50 Index (Intraday (Current Week Expiry)).</li>\n  <li><strong>Entry Window:</strong> Between 9:20 AM and 3:00 PM IST.</li>\n  <li><strong>Trigger Condition:</strong> At 3:10 PM IST (15:15 IST entry window), buys 1 Lot ATM Call and 1 Lot ATM Put option for NIFTY 50 current weekly expiry to capture late-market directional momentum and gamma expansion.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>2. <strong>Exit Criteria & Risk Parameters:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Target & Stop Loss:</strong> Target: 1.5x entry price (+50%). Stop Loss: 0.8x entry price (-20%). Universal Exit at 3:29 PM IST (15:29 IST).</li>\n  <li><strong>Universal Exit:</strong> Square off all intraday open positions at 3:15 PM IST.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>3. <strong>Additional Mechanics:</strong></p><ul><li>Square off strictly enforced at 3:29 PM (1529) before market close to avoid overnight gap risk.</li></ul>\n",
